WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
And the brain, because she's very smart, in all fairness.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.200
But she did it from the heart.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.840
And she did it, and everybody was talking about it.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.480
She exposed some of these fake senators,

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.640
these terrible senators, people like Blumenthal

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.960
that had a phony war record.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.440
For 20 years, he talked about what a hero he was,

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.680
and it turned out he never went to Vietnam.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.400
For 20 years, he talked about being a hero in Vietnam,

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.440
then it was exposed.

